### Dana invites someone, then thinks better of it
# @name RevokedInvite
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [201]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/tenants/{{AcmeId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{DanaAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": ["technician"] }

###
# @name RevokeIt
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [204]
DELETE {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/tenants/{{AcmeId}}/invitations/{{RevokedInvite.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{DanaAccess}}

### An invitation that lapses within the run
# @name ExpiringInvite
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [201]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/tenants/{{AcmeId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{DanaAccess}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": ["technician"], "expiresAt": "{{ExpiresSoon}}" }

### Its preview, polled (anonymous and side-effect free) until the code is dead — at most ~30 s
# @name ExpiredPreview
## RETRY-UNTIL-TEST-PASS: The expiring invitation has expired.
## RETRY-MAX-ATTEMPTS: 30
## RETRY-BACKOFF-TYPE: Constant
## RETRY-MAX-DELAY: 00:00:01
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/invitations/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{ExpiringInvite.response.body.$.code}}" }
